    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "....\nN207AU\nThe Spirit of the We\nFrontier",
      "The second aircraft in Frontier Airlines' fleet, this B737-200\njet, N207AU, began service as flight #204 from Denver to Bismarck\non July 5, 1994. Port: Coyote. Starboard: Black Bear Cub.\nPush back: 11:15a • Taxi: 11:18a • Take off: 11:30a\nMinneapolis/\nSt. Paul\nChicago/\n-O Midway\nSeattle/Tacoma\nSalt Lakg City\nSan Francisco\nLos Angeles\nDenver\nPhoenix\nBoston\no New York\nLaGuardia\nO Bloomington-\nNormal\n-O Baltimore/\nWashington D.C.\nFrontier\nAlbuquerque\nEl Paso O\nYOUR LOW FARE CHOICE\nFor reservations and information, please call your Travel Agent or\nFrontier Airlines at 1-800-432-1359.\nWildlife photography by Tom Tietz\n© 1996 Frontier Airlines\n2015.166.0710"
    ],
